	"info":"Fusion ring. mult_tab: structure constants. barcode & formal_code: unique identifiers see (DOI: 10.1063\/5.0148848). non_trivial_sub_fusion_rings: tuples where the first element = elements of ring that form subring isomorphic to subring identified by second element of the tuple. software: doi of original software used to represent fusion ring. references: doi of paper from which data was obtained. categorifiable: false=not categorifiable, null= unknown. categorifications: if categorifiable then anyonwiki codes of pivotal (braided) fusion cats that categorify ring. numeric_projective_SL2Z_reps: each rep consists of a generalized S-matrix and a vector of vectors representing the ln(diag(T))\/(2 pi i) of a generalized T-matrix."
